      "content": "it's just so quiet here. i keep looking at the corner where his bed used to be and it's like... everything is just empty. i don't even know why i'm bothering to get up or do anything anymore. what's even the point of it all if the only thing that actually made me feel okay is just gone? it feels so stupid even saying it but i feel like i'm just existing for no reason.",
